          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "style": "normal",
              "_key": "br0",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "_key": "br1",
                  "text": "What happens when strict Weimar grid discipline meets emotional color fields? Heavy 2px structural borders hold the page together while deep crimson, saffron ochre, and midnight ultramarine glow from within."
